[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3004.71, "timestamp": "00:50:04", "text": "ここです。いや、いや。もう一つ。もう一方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3014.71, "timestamp": "00:50:14", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3016.39, "timestamp": "00:50:16", "text": "そう、それだ。はい、これでいいでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3028.71, "timestamp": "00:50:28", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3036.63, "timestamp": "00:50:36", "text": "私のやり方。待って、テキストを聞いた？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3039.03, "timestamp": "00:50:39", "text": "スピーチ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3041.51, "timestamp": "00:50:41", "text": "テキスト読み上げ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3045.349, "timestamp": "00:50:45", "text": "いいえ、できません。ええと、彼らは考えている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3047.75, "timestamp": "00:50:47", "text": "そういうものを追加する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3052.309, "timestamp": "00:50:52", "text": "ああ。 MODを使えば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3054.58, "timestamp": "00:50:54", "text": "ええ、それについてはたくさんありますよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3056.549, "timestamp": "00:50:56", "text": "[音楽]"}]